{"product":"Foundations Beginner Box","set":"FDN","kind":"beginner","glossary":{"Deathtouch":"Any amount of damage this deals to a creature, even 1, is enough to destroy it.","Double":"Some effects double a number, such as a creature's power, the +1/+1 counters on it, or the damage dealt to a player.","Double strike":"This creature deals combat damage twice: once before creatures without first strike, and again at the normal time.","Enchant":"Found on Auras, it says what the Aura can be attached to (such as a creature or a land); if that thing leaves the battlefield, the Aura goes to the graveyard.","Equip":"Pay the equip cost to attach this Equipment to a creature you control, but only on your own turn when you could cast a sorcery.","First strike":"This creature deals its combat damage before creatures without first strike, so it can often defeat an opponent before getting hit back.","Flash":"You may cast this card any time you could cast an instant, even during your opponent's turn.","Flying":"Can only be blocked by creatures with flying or reach.","Haste":"This creature can attack and use its tap abilities on the same turn it comes under your control.","Kicker":"You may pay an extra kicker cost as you cast this spell to get a bigger or additional effect.","Lifelink":"Damage dealt by this creature also makes you gain that much life.","Mill":"To mill a number of cards, put that many cards from the top of a library into its owner's graveyard.","Raid":"Raid abilities give a bonus if you attacked with a creature earlier this turn.","Reach":"This creature can block creatures with flying.","Scry":"Look at the top N cards of your library, then put any of them on the bottom and the rest back on top in any order.","Trample":"When this creature attacks and is blocked, any damage beyond what is needed to destroy its blockers can be dealt to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.","Treasure":"A Treasure is an artifact token you can tap and sacrifice to add one mana of any color.","Vigilance":"Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap, so it can still block on your opponent's turn.","Ward":"Whenever this becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, that spell or ability is canceled unless they pay the ward cost."},"cards":{"0102e0be-5783-4825-9489-713b1b1df0b2":{"n":"Beast-Kin Ranger","t":"Creature — Elf Ranger","c":3.0,"r":"common","kw":["Trample"]},"01ceca57-65f4-4f99-bd14-9fe5f86c1f62":{"n":"Joraga Invocation","t":"Sorcery","c":6.0,"r":"uncommon"},"0259e4d8-849b-468e-a902-aa1d7f2d5b6a":{"n":"Goblin Oriflamme","t":"Enchantment","c":2.0,"r":"uncommon"},"027dc444-e544-4693-8653-3dcdda530162":{"n":"Dazzling Angel","t":"Creature — Angel","c":3.0,"r":"common","kw":["Flying"]},"03a49535-c5f3-4a6f-b333-7ac7bffdc9ae":{"n":"Spectral Sailor","t":"Creature — Spirit Pirate","c":1.0,"r":"uncommon","kw":["Flash","Flying"]},"03a5e19c-4cb8-4bd7-923c-4db747dc6ca3":{"n":"Crossway Troublemakers","t":"Creature — Vampire","c":6.0,"r":"rare"},"05937911-897b-4638-9536-2e463884f453":{"n":"Untamed Hunger","t":"Enchantment — Aura","c":3.0,"r":"common","kw":["Enchant"]},"06431793-5dfe-4cbf-990b-4bcc960d1f31":{"n":"Arcane Epiphany","t":"Instant","c":5.0,"r":"uncommon"},"098c86fd-5a38-41fd-be44-ab963448f2a2":{"n":"Quick Study","t":"Instant","c":3.0,"r":"common"},"13505c15-14e0-4200-82bd-fb9bce949e68":{"n":"Swamp","t":"Basic Land — Swamp","c":0.0,"r":"common"},"16dfd7b3-6d01-4e98-aec3-b27e8e2444e8":{"n":"Bishop's Soldier","t":"Creature — Vampire Soldier","c":2.0,"r":"common","kw":["Lifelink"]},"172cd5b7-98fc-4add-b858-a0b3dfb75c19":{"n":"Uncharted Haven","t":"Land","c":0.0,"r":"common"},"17b25850-f1bd-4410-beec-603b2a77f264":{"n":"Leonin Vanguard","t":"Creature — Cat Soldier","c":1.0,"r":"uncommon"},"17e2b637-72b1-4457-aaba-66d51107be4c":{"n":"Island","t":"Basic Land — Island","c":0.0,"r":"common"},"189f6199-f2fe-49a5-89ca-3c4cb39fbf2b":{"n":"Thornweald Archer","t":"Creature — Elf Archer","c":2.0,"r":"common","kw":["Deathtouch","Reach"]},"