:"Goblins","colors":["R"],"description":"A red pack of fast, scrappy goblins. It plays lots of small creatures and makes them hit harder when they attack together.","plan":"Attack early and often: get several goblins out, use Goblin Oriflamme and Dropkick Bomber to make them stronger, and use Frenzied Goblin or Goblin Smuggler to keep your opponent's creatures from blocking. Save Incinerating Blast for the one big creature standing in your way.","pairsWith":["Cats","Vampires","Elves"],"standouts":["Dropkick Bomber","Raging Redcap","Incinerating Blast"],"keywords":["Haste","Double strike","Flash"],"variants":[{"v":1,"cards":[["b44f758e-716a-408e-96d4-b58403591c2a",1],["d58e20ab-c5ca-4295-884d-78efdaa83243",1],["d5592573-2889-40b1-b1d5-c2802482549a",1],["fee05f7e-d4da-4a72-8140-d505eecbdd32",1],["f9abe517-f601-4784-8d62-2350bd755146",1],["0259e4d8-849b-468e-a902-aa1d7f2d5b6a",1],["5837ccf1-9bac-4afb-bcc9-82c5f3c0e8e2",1],["af158462-91e3-4ad7-b435-95d4eb32fe0a",1],["9627b0a7-bda9-44df-81c9-aa70cc976331",1],["8db11970-74c2-463d-88bb-9f88aa079eaa",1],["7fc914fe-e699-4a21-aa09-f3573d020b87",1],["55ab3f99-9541-4100-818c-5d9e916791e4",1],["172cd5b7-98fc-4add-b858-a0b3dfb75c19",1],["279df7e2-2a3b-464a-a7df-e91da28e3a8c",4],["1edc5050-69bd-416d-b04c-7f82de2a1901",3]]}]},{"name":"Healing","colors":["W"],"description":"A white pack of angels and protectors that gain life over and over. Several of its creatures grow stronger every time you gain life.","plan":"Play creatures like Ajani's Pridemate and Twinblade Paladin first, then add creatures that gain you life when they arrive or attack, so your growing creatures get a +1/+1 counter each time. Fly over blockers with your angels and Ancestor Dragon while your high life total keeps you safe.","pairsWith":["Vampires","Cats"],"standouts":["Ancestor Dragon","Ajani's Pridemate","Prayer of Binding"],"keywords":["Flying","Equip","Lifelink","Flash"],"variants":[{"v":1,"cards":[["df43d9d4-3fef-4a56-8b38-d52824117201",1],["027dc444-e544-