opponent's turn), sends creatures back to their owner's hand, and rewards you for attacking.","plan":"Keep mana open on your opponent's turn so you can cast Spectral Sailor or Brineborn Cutthroat by surprise, or Cancel their spell. Attack first, then play Storm Fleet Spy or Skyship Buccaneer after combat to draw an extra card, and use Corsair Captain to make your other pirates stronger.","pairsWith":["Goblins","Wizards","Inferno"],"standouts":["Corsair Captain","Spectral Sailor","Bigfin Bouncer"],"keywords":["Flash","Flying","Raid","Treasure","Ward","Enchant","Scry","Equip"],"variants":[{"v":1,"cards":[["d5017dbc-07fd-45ea-9629-7c584144e8be",1],["9b1d5b76-b07e-45c6-800d-4cfce085164f",1],["62958fc3-55dc-4b97-a070-490d6ed27820",1],["acf7aafb-931f-49e5-8691-eab8cb34b05e",1],["03a49535-c5f3-4a6f-b333-7ac7bffdc9ae",1],["2569d4f3-55ed-4f99-9592-34c7df0aab72",1],["475bff39-220a-4490-9c2e-d311e306a6db",1],["475e28bb-1333-45e1-b6fd-83121c2f1ab9",1],["c82d7c6d-523c-46c9-a189-44c0bd8386d1",1],["58d26b54-0093-4e90-a2b1-b57c64340f9c",1],["f6c5206e-63db-44c0-86ab-f645cd358b3b",1],["d9d20aef-d35b-4353-a241-e6cfa9730975",1],["172cd5b7-98fc-4add-b858-a0b3dfb75c19",1],["17e2b637-72b1-4457-aaba-66d51107be4c",4],["23635e40-d040-40b7-8b98-90ed362aa028",3]]}]},{"name":"Primal","colors":["G"],"description":"A green pack of big beasts that keep growing. It adds +1/+1 counters to its creatures, which make them permanently bigger, and gives them trample so extra damage gets through blockers.","plan":"Use Druid of the Cowl and New Horizons to get extra mana, then play larger creatures and grow them with counters and Giant Growth. Land Aggressive Mammoth to give your whole team trample, and use Bite Down to have your biggest creature knock out an enemy.","pairsWith":["Cats","Elves","Inferno"],"standouts":["Aggressive Mammoth","Wildwood Scourge","Bite Down"],"keywords":["Trample","Double","Reach","Enchant"],"variants":[{"v":1,"cards":[["7724b978-999b-4654-96f3-58e28aa7cb34",1],["f8d70b3b-f6f9-4