rong spells that destroy or weaken enemy creatures.","plan":"This is the other learn-to-play deck, and your first game against Cats teaches the other side of combat: Vampire Interloper shows that flying gets past ground blockers (but it can't block), Vampire Spawn and Vampire Neonate show you can win by draining life without attacking, and Hero's Downfall and Moment of Craving show how removal spells clear the way. Late in the game Crossway Troublemakers gives attacking vampires deathtouch and lifelink, and Untamed Hunger adds menace, so they are very hard to block well.","pairsWith":["Healing","Undead","Goblins"],"standouts":["Crossway Troublemakers","Vampire Spawn","Hero's Downfall"],"keywords":["Flying","Enchant"],"learn":true,"variants":[{"v":1,"cards":[["319bc1f0-ee42-44e5-b08b-735613ded2ba",4],["13505c15-14e0-4200-82bd-fb9bce949e68",3],["65455d94-487c-4104-a1a0-149515a90eaa",1],["b6fc8d2e-ad63-498d-83b6-5f72b5ae0e67",1],["3627f9fb-b828-49cd-887d-e2ab3ef43dfb",1],["53c56a23-eb4f-4be1-ada9-1ad5b80195d3",1],["05937911-897b-4638-9536-2e463884f453",1],["ff16d951-dd85-4d22-9505-ce6e2eaf47cf",1],["03a5e19c-4cb8-4bd7-923c-4db747dc6ca3",1],["bd0c12dd-f138-45c0-9614-d83a1d8e8399",1],["ad2c01d9-8f54-46c0-9dc9-d4d4764ce1c9",1],["86d64a1d-cda4-4c76-8d58-ccab5a6859a0",1],["6d5802ed-507d-4a52-90e3-d989cd61961b",1],["485d6a5a-2054-47d5-91b8-71ce308ed4dc",1],["172cd5b7-98fc-4add-b858-a0b3dfb75c19",1]]}]},{"name":"Wizards","colors":["U"],"description":"A blue pack of clever wizards that draw lots of extra cards. Its creatures get stronger or make flying helpers when you draw more than one card in a turn.","plan":"Draw extra cards with Fleeting Distraction, Quick Study, and Arcane Epiphany to power up Clinquant Skymage and Mischievous Mystic. Slow your opponent down by sending their creatures back to their hand with Exclusion Mage and Into the Roil, or lock one down with Starlight Snare, while your fliers attack.","pairsWith":["Inferno","Pirates","Undead"],"standouts":["Mischievous Mystic","Clinquant Skymage","Exclusion Mage"],"keywords":["Flying","Flash","Kicker","Enchant"],"variants":[{"v":1,"cards":[["c069ff32-6759-48a2-8674-4f729c91dcd0",1],["06431793-5dfe-4cbf-990b-4bcc960d1f31",1],["36012810-0e83-4640-8ba7-7262229f1b84",1],["9273c417-0fcd-4273-b24e-afff76336d0c",1],["fd0eba76-3829-408b-828f-0b223c884728",1],["20d89cec-528b-4b2a-87db-e11ce0000622",1],["c0b86a7b-4912-43a7-ab89-c3432385baa1",1],["c5f11ea2-cd4c-417a-804c-3df80d9ddd5f",1],["62c8024e-490a-484a-bcee-da7728a64a1f",1],["25edefa9-9fff-4b71-83ae-696c196a795c",1],["098c86fd-5a38-41fd-be44-ab963448f2a2",1],["74fb19b2-4f6c-4cbd-8756-a7eb5c7c9ef6",1],["172cd5b7-98fc-4add-b858-a0b3dfb75c19",1],["17e2b637-72b1-4457-aaba-66d51107be4c",4],["23635e40-d040-40b7-8b98-90ed362aa028",3]]}]}]}